\pard\sa200\f1\fs36 PromptMIDI is installed\par
\pard\sa160\f0\fs26 Open your DAW, rescan plug-ins if it asks, and add \f1 PromptMIDI\f0  to an instrument track (it is listed as an instrument). Or open the PromptMIDI app from Applications.\par
Type what you want, press \f1 Generate\f0 , listen with \f1 Play\f0 , then drag the MIDI into your DAW.\par
When there is a new version, PromptMIDI tells you inside its window: click \f1 Download\f0  and run the new installer.\par
The ReadMe is in /Library/Application Support/PromptMIDI.\par
